{'symbol': 'GM', 'date': '2022-03-17 09:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MOTORS NAMES HANON SYSTEMS A 2021 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR', 'text': 'SEOUL, SOUTH KOREA, MARCH 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENERAL MOTORS RECOGNIZED GLOBAL AUTOMOTIVE THERMAL AND ENERGY MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS SUPPLIER HANON SYSTEMS AS A 2021 SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR. GM CELEBRATED HONOREES AT ITS 30TH ANNUAL SUPPLIER OF THE YEAR AWARDS CEREMONY IN PHOENIX, ARIZONA, EARLIER THIS WEEK.'}